jAyMQ","thumb_url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/rKpbKKewUvM/hqdefault.jpg","blocks":null,"service_name":"YouTube","service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/youtube.png","thumb_width":480,"thumb_height":360,"video_html":"\u003ciframe width=\"400\" height=\"300\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/rKpbKKewUvM?feature=oembed\u0026autoplay=1\u0026iv_load_policy=3\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen\u003e\u003c/iframe\u003e","video_html_width":400,"video_html_height":300,"from_url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rKpbKKewUvM\u0026amp;list=TLGGtAFSmteVE7AwODAzMjAyMQ","original_url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rKpbKKewUvM\u0026amp;list=TLGGtAFSmteVE7AwODAzMjAyMQ"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2Kp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a3d3db3d-2b43-4b36-b827-444f0836983c","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"LSPでVSCodeと同じこと出来るってのもちょっと見せたいんだけどなー","ts":"1615180018.258900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zET4l"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6acd3e8d-3289-4092-b8fc-ffb892cfe72d","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"そうですね、練習はしようと思います","ts":"1615179990.258200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+qOK1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7966ae81-ef98-4370-b1d1-9c4bfa64b29e","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"あとデモは練習しとかないと、ぶっつけだと走る(早めに終わる)のでお気を付けて。","ts":"1615179979.257900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IJf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a3b83dc9-3b51-44fb-80c7-de40d9ed3ff2","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"いくつかのデモを用意して、それがストーリーに沿っているとキレイですね。上の動画の例なら\n\n1. 複数のファイルにまたがっている変数名を書き換えないといけません！LSP の rename 機能は使えません！あなたのエディタならどうします？（問題提起）\n2. まずは grep でその変数の位置を把握しましょう。 fzf-preview なら簡単にできるんですよ（デモ1）\n3. 続いて quickfix でさくっと書き換えましょう？（ここ私にも何やってるのかよく分からなかった）（デモ2）\n4. gina プラグインと連携すれば、 add も commit も diff プレビューも、ほらこの通り簡単にできます（デモ3）\nみたいな感じで分けるとか、ですかね","ts":"1615179960.257300","edited":{"user":"UL6CFN8NR","ts":"1615180776.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":2,"users":["U7B4ZD49X","U01J7703PFT"]},{"name":"subara","count":3,"users":["U01J7703PFT","U017BU3UZBQ","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BoGJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"52472592-2528-46f1-a8e0-666675d00931","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"1つ2分として2.5個くらいか","ts":"1615179916.256600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KnYQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1c5db548-8b85-424c-a7b4-79f30fc8dba6","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"まぁ聞いてみるか収めるかにはしようと思います","ts":"1615179796.254400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"X0+BY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a605d99b-704b-4000-bd7c-fa915b71ce69","type":"message","user":"U01J7703PFT","text":"根回ししてない限り、基本は時間厳守を想定してた方が良いかも","ts":"1615179776.253700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cxE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e7a5f41f-7f5c-4048-851e-5dea35dba02a","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"vim止めないといけないのありますよね、ただでさえ分かりにくいんで","ts":"1615179765.253400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YoT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"212e027e-a46c-464e-b9ab-b58530fd988c","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"上の動画はたしかにスゴいですが、非 Vimmer には何やってるのか数秒おきに止めて説明しないと多分ついてけない気がw","ts":"1615179707.251200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":2,"users":["U7B4ZD49X","U01J7703PFT"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uIcnE"}]},